== Suggested Campaign Progression
+ #strong[Liu Bei or Sun Jian] (Normal) --- learn the basics
+ #strong[Cao Cao] (Hard) --- learn diplomacy & manipulation
+ #strong[Any faction you like] (Very Hard) --- apply everything
+ #strong[Hard starting faction] (Legendary) --- master level
